Cost and resources per accepted useful output (@mat-material-cost: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @materials-engineering, #source "../sources/Economic-and-Environmental-Materials-Selection-MIT.lingua#r_36KMERFT8SDRP30MT63KQ5WS6C", #source "../sources/Sustainable-Materials-Selection-DOE.lingua#r_04ADQ1BN156GM7AVH5N2T7EAJZ", #materials-engineering "../../mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design/manufacturing/Make-buy-capacity-and-the-cost-of-useful-parts.lingua#r_3JKS2MK3JP6FKB4MENRQDSP6YH") { r_109Y60MW4B48Z4KBQPE0J10454
**Read:** [Economic and environmental issues in materials selection — MIT 3.080](../sources/Economic-and-Environmental-Materials-Selection-MIT.lingua#r_36KMERFT8SDRP30MT63KQ5WS6C), the complete economics/cost-modeling lectures, EE assignments and CM1; [Sustainable Materials Selection in Manufactured Products — DOE, 2023](../sources/Sustainable-Materials-Selection-DOE.lingua#r_04ADQ1BN156GM7AVH5N2T7EAJZ), framework. Continue through the shared mechanical production-resource account.

Purchase price per kilogram omits geometry, yield, tooling, labor, energy, treatment, inspection and rejects. For N attempted parts with accepted fraction y, a simplified cost per accepted part is [fixed cost + N×variable cost]/(yN). State the boundary: rework, salvage and feedback may require a richer balance. Do not count recovered scrap as both avoided purchase and full sale income without following the flows.

Batch size, throughput and downtime change cost and resource use. Different routes can cross over with production volume. Cost estimates require a date, location, currency basis, scale and included activities. Life-cycle financial comparisons also need a declared discounting convention, distinct from physical mass and energy balances.

**Work:** Derive a two-route crossover with different tooling, cycle time and accepted yield. Independently check total material and useful output. Vary demand and failure/rework assumptions. Explain which economically attractive option relies on unverified process capability or an unavailable supply state.

**Return:** [Materials engineering — structure, processing and useful behavior](../Materials-engineering.lingua#r_05BF5JM8141RKF1VT5998YFZQ9).
